msgid "Test patterns only. Not a measurement of your media."
msgstr "Nur Testmuster. Keine Messung deiner Medien."

msgid "Live scopes wait for the graded render-adapter tap. Display pixels are not used as measurements. Saved grades and export stay unchanged."
msgstr "Live-Scopes warten auf den gerenderten Adapter-Tap. Anzeige-Pixel werden nicht als Messung genutzt. Gespeicherte Grades und Export bleiben unverändert."

msgid "Engine tap measurement for the selected clip."
msgstr "Engine-Tap-Messung für den ausgewählten Clip."

msgid "No live scope tap yet"
msgstr "Noch kein Live-Scope-Tap"

msgid "Dropped frames: {count}"
msgstr "Ausgelassene Frames: {count}"

msgid "Test pattern — not a media measurement"
msgstr "Testmuster — keine Medienmessung"

msgid "Engine tap measurement"
msgstr "Engine-Tap-Messung"

msgid "Project composite tap"
msgstr "Projekt-Composite-Tap"

msgid "Downsampled measurement"
msgstr "Heruntergerechnete Messung"

msgid "Scopes never change the saved grade or export. Histogram uses 256 bins. Waveform and parade use Y′ / R′G′B′. Vectorscope uses BT.709 Cb/Cr."
msgstr "Scopes ändern weder den gespeicherten Grade noch den Export. Histogramm: 256 Bins. Waveform und Parade: Y′ / R′G′B′. Vectorscope: BT.709 Cb/Cr."
